---
name: demo-skill
description: 'Scan a path: report findings. Use when the user asks to scan. Before publishing a repository.'
license: Apache-2.0
metadata:
  short-description: Scan for findings
---
<!-- agentport:args:begin -->
> **Arguments**: invoked as `$demo-skill [path | --all]`. The text typed after the skill name is the arguments; wherever this file says `$ARGUMENTS`, use that text.
<!-- agentport:args:end -->

# Demo skill

Scan $ARGUMENTS and report each finding.

Run [the helper](scripts/run.sh) for the heavy lifting.
